description: "Mobius is a small Tampa Bay firm that acts as the tech partner for local businesses. Meet the founders and see how we work, what we believe and what we charge."
---

<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">About us</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl">A small Tampa Bay firm that looks after your tech</h1>
    <p class="lede mt-6">Mobius Integration is the tech partner for local businesses in {{ site.region }}. We look after your website, accessibility, booking and follow-up, Google listing and everyday tech questions, so you have one team to call.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-700">We are a new firm. We don't have a long client list to point to yet, and we'd rather tell you that than pretend otherwise. What we can offer is a free look at your own business, fixed prices in writing, and the people who do the work answering your questions.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-gray-50">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="h-section">The people</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-lg text-gray-700">Two founders run Mobius. When you reach out, you're talking to one of them.</p>
    <ul class="mt-8 grid list-none gap-6 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {% for founder in site.founders %}
      <li class="card">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">{{ founder.name }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 font-medium text-indigo-800">{{ founder.role }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="h-section">How we work</h2>
    <ul class="mt-8 grid list-none gap-6 p-0 md:grid-cols-2">
      <li class="card">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">You talk to the person doing the work</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700">No account managers and no hand-offs. The person who listens to your problem is the person who plans the fix.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">Fixed prices, in writing</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700">{{ packages.terms[1] }} If a project doesn't fit one of our packages, we quote it after a free scoping call.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">Plain English</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700">We explain what we found, what we'd change and why, without jargon. If you have to ask what a word means, we haven't done our job.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">Reachable when you are</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700">{{ site.callHours }}. We reply within {{ site.responseTime }}. We're a small team, so we don't promise 24/7 support or same-day answers.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-8 text-gray-700">See what we charge on the <a class="link" href="/pricing/">packages page</a>, or read the <a class="link" href="/faq/">frequently asked questions</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-gray-50">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="h-section">What we believe</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-lg text-gray-700">These are things we do, not slogans.</p>
    <ul class="mt-8 grid list-none gap-6 p-0 md:grid-cols-2">
      <li class="card">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">We tell you when you don't need us</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700">If your current site or software is fine, or the fix is a setting you can change yourself, we'll say so.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">We fix the boring things first</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700">A booking button that works and a Google listing with the right hours matter more than anything flashy. We start there.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">We write down what we change</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700">You get a record of what we did and why, so you aren't dependent on our memory, or on us.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">We build for every customer</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700">That includes people using a keyboard, a screen reader or a small phone. Our own site is held to the same standard, and our <a class="link" href="/accessibility/">accessibility statement</a> says where it falls short.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section band-dark on-dark">
  <div class="wrap-narrow text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-medium text-white md:text-4xl">Start with a free look at your business</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-100">The Free Tech Checkup is a 20-minute call and a written report on your website, booking flow and Google presence.</p>
    <a class="btn-light mt-8" href="{{ site.writeupCta.href }}">Get my free website write-up</a>
  </div>
</section>
